    "SonarCloud": "crwdns119033:0crwdne119033:0",
    "Koko is a (WIP) self-hosted media server written in Rust. At this point in time this is a learning project,\nand you": "crwdns112300:0crwdne112300:0",
    "SHOULD NOT": "crwdns112302:0crwdne112302:0",
    "use this for any purpose. I don’t know what I am doing and the code is probably terrible.\nThis is also": "crwdns112304:0crwdne112304:0",
    "NOT": "crwdns112306:0crwdne112306:0",
    "a functioning media server yet. Once it is, I will update this README.": "crwdns112308:0crwdne112308:0",
    "Current product direction highlights:": "crwdns119035:0crwdne119035:0",
    "The browser UI is targeting a Kodi/Plex-style media-first experience.": "crwdns119037:0crwdne119037:0",
    "TheMovieDB is the first planned online metadata source for movies and TV.": "crwdns119039:0crwdne119039:0",
    "Packaged builds include": "crwdns119041:0crwdne119041:0",
    "ffmpeg": "crwdns119043:0crwdne119043:0",
    "and": "crwdns119045:0crwdne119045:0",
    "ffprobe": "crwdns119047:0crwdne119047:0",
    "from LizardByte/build-deps. Explicit executable paths remain configurable.": "crwdns119049:0crwdne119049:0",
    "macOS packages require macOS 15.0 or later.": "crwdns119051:0crwdne119051:0",
    "If you are interested in this project, please leave a star and watch the repository for updates.": "crwdns112310:0crwdne112310:0",
    "If you would like to contribute, please reach out on our": "crwdns112312:0crwdne112312:0",
    "discord": "crwdns112314:0crwdne112314:0",
    "server.\nContributor references are available in": "crwdns119053:0crwdne119053:0",
    "contributing": "crwdns119055:0crwdne119055:0",
    "Koko uses a YAML configuration file for core server settings.": "crwdns119057:0crwdne119057:0",
    "Media libraries are stored in the application database instead of the YAML file. The browser settings UI edits\nserver settings in YAML and library definitions in the database.": "crwdns119059:0crwdne119059:0",
    "To move a library, move its files, update the existing library’s paths in": "crwdns119061:0crwdne119061:0",
    "Settings → Libraries": "crwdns119063:0crwdne119063:0",
    ",\nand rescan it. Keep the same library to retain matched metadata, reading and playback progress, and\nplaylists. Check that the new paths are accessible to the server before scanning. Deleting the library\nand creating a new one starts a separate catalog.": "crwdns119065:0crwdne119065:0",
    "Open an item to find": "crwdns119067:0crwdne119067:0",
    "More like this": "crwdns119069:0crwdne119069:0",
    ", when related items are available in your accessible libraries.\nThe row shows the same kind of item: albums lead to albums and artists to artists.\nSuggestions are unavailable for individual songs, TV seasons, and episodes; open their album,\nartist, or show page instead.\nAfter adding files, scan their library so they can appear here. To update suggestions, refresh the\nitem’s metadata from its management controls, or ask your server administrator. The row stays hidden\nwhen no similar items are available.": "crwdns119071:0crwdne119071:0",
    "For book and audiobook folders, supported formats, reading and listening controls, and metadata sources,\nsee": "crwdns119073:0crwdne119073:0",
    "Books, audiobooks, and comics": "crwdns119075:0crwdne119075:0",
    ".\nFor movie library naming guidance, see": "crwdns119077:0crwdne119077:0",
    "Movie naming guidelines": "crwdns119079:0crwdne119079:0",
    ".\nFor library setup, metadata providers, and playback, see": "crwdns119081:0crwdne119081:0",
    "Music libraries": "crwdns119083:0crwdne119083:0",
    ".\nFor folder layouts and embedded tags, see": "crwdns119085:0crwdne119085:0",
    "Music naming": "crwdns119087:0crwdne119087:0",
    ".\nFor podcast discovery, RSS subscriptions, and episode playback, see": "crwdns119089:0crwdne119089:0",
    "Podcasts": "crwdns112450:0crwdne112450:0",
    ".\nFor video quality settings and playback troubleshooting, see": "crwdns119091:0crwdne119091:0",
    "Video playback": "crwdns119093:0crwdne119093:0",
    "The file must be named": "crwdns112320:0crwdne112320:0",
    "settings.yml": "crwdns112322:0crwdne112322:0",
    "and be placed in the following location, depending on your OS.": "crwdns112324:0crwdne112324:0",
    "OS": "crwdns112326:0crwdne112326:0",
