    "prepare": "crwdns119151:0crwdne119151:0",
    "automatically from\nthe release tag matching the current": "crwdns119153:0crwdne119153:0",
    "third-party/build-deps": "crwdns119155:0crwdne119155:0",
    "submodule commit. Initialize that submodule\nwith": "crwdns119157:0crwdne119157:0",
    "git submodule update --init third-party/build-deps": "crwdns119159:0crwdne119159:0",
    ". Git, curl, and tar must be available on": "crwdns119161:0crwdne119161:0",
    "PATH": "crwdns119163:0crwdne119163:0",
    ".\nDownloads are cached in Cargo’s build output directory; CI bundles tools from that same package.\nTo update the dependency, check out a different published release tag in the submodule.": "crwdns119165:0crwdne119165:0",
    "Packaged builds resolve omitted FFmpeg paths from": "crwdns119167:0crwdne119167:0",
    "ffmpeg/bin": "crwdns119169:0crwdne119169:0",
    "beside the Koko executable. Local builds\nalso search the package prepared by Cargo. Explicit": "crwdns119171:0crwdne119171:0",
    "ffmpeg_path": "crwdns119173:0crwdne119173:0",
    "ffprobe_path": "crwdns119175:0crwdne119175:0",
    "settings take precedence.": "crwdns119177:0crwdne119177:0",
    "Set": "crwdns119179:0crwdne119179:0",
    "KOKO_FFMPEG_ROOT": "crwdns119181:0crwdne119181:0",
    "to an extracted build-deps package’s": "crwdns119183:0crwdne119183:0",
    "directory to use locally built tools.\nFor an offline build, use that override or set": "crwdns119185:0crwdne119185:0",
    "CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true": "crwdns119187:0crwdne119187:0",
    "with an already cached package.\nSet": "crwdns119189:0crwdne119189:0",
    "KOKO_SKIP_FFMPEG_DOWNLOAD=1": "crwdns119191:0crwdne119191:0",
    "to use tools supplied separately through settings or": "crwdns119193:0crwdne119193:0",
    "Flatpak uses": "crwdns119195:0crwdne119195:0",
    "packaging/linux/flatpak/modules/ffmpeg.json": "crwdns119197:0crwdne119197:0",
    ", matching Sunshine’s downloads and extraction\ninto": "crwdns119199:0crwdne119199:0",
    ". Its launcher adds": "crwdns119201:0crwdne119201:0",
    "to": "crwdns119203:0crwdne119203:0",
    ", and its offline build skips Cargo’s download.\nThe shared update workflow advances the build-deps submodule and refreshes the Flatpak module together.": "crwdns119205:0crwdne119205:0",
